label.text:
Step ${nextStep.stepNumber}: ${nextStep.characteristicName}, sample ${
                                                nextStep.sampleNumber}${nextStep.limitsText ? ' (' + nextStep.limitsText + ')' :
                                                ''}

${inspection.resultText}: ${inspection.quantityAccepted} accepted, ${
                                        inspection.quantityRejected} rejected. Verifying releases no stock; its
                                        disposition does.

Left to dispose: ${detail.acceptedLeft} accepted (Release) and ${
                                        detail.rejectedLeft} rejected (the other dispositions). Release reserves waiting
                                        demand first and makes the stock available.

${'Sample of ' + inspection.sampleSize + ' from ' + inspection.quantity +
                                (inspection.templateName ? ', template ' + inspection.templateName + ' as of ' +
                                inspection.templateAsOfDateText : ', no template')}

${inspection.assetId ? 'Stock ' + inspection.assetId + ' at ' +
                                (inspection.assetLocationSeqId || 'no location') + ', ' + (inspection.assetOnHand || '0') +
                                ' on hand' : 'No stock held for it'}

${inspection.resultText}: ${inspection.quantityAccepted} accepted, ${
                                inspection.quantityRejected} rejected${inspection.resultReason ? ' (' +
                                inspection.resultReason + ')' : ''}. Submitted by ${inspection.submittedByName} on ${
                                inspection.submittedDateText}.
